sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor S as Student
  participant UI as EventRegisterModal.jsx
  participant API as api.js / Express :5000
  participant DB as backend/db.js
  participant TKT as TicketPassModal.jsx
  S->>UI: Fill Student ID, Phone, UTR & Submit
  UI->>UI: Validate /[ROSN]\d{6}/, phone, UTR
  UI->>API: POST /api/registrations (Bearer user.id)
  API->>API: Verify ID regex & UTR >= 8 chars (if paid)
  API->>DB: getEventById(event_id)
  DB-->>API: Event metadata & capacity
  API->>DB: createRegistration(payload)
  DB->>DB: Check duplicate & increment registered_count
  DB-->>API: Created Registration (ticket_code)
  API-->>UI: HTTP 201 JSON Registration
  UI->>TKT: Pass registration + event props
  TKT->>TKT: QRCode.toDataURL(ticket_code)
  TKT-->>S: Display QR E-Ticket & Printable Pass
